---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import {site} from '../../data/site.mjs';
---
<Base title="Mobile App Development Northern Ireland" description="Have an app idea? Discuss mobile app development with Glen Adamson at Modern Software, Portadown. Practical scoping, React Native experience and connected web systems." structuredData={{'@type':'Service',name:'Mobile app development Northern Ireland',provider:{'@id':site.url+'/#organization'},areaServed:{'@type':'Place',name:'Northern Ireland'},url:site.url+'/mobile-app-development'}}>
  <section class="app-lead wrap">
    <div class="app-intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">MODERN SOFTWARE · PORTADOWN, NORTHERN IRELAND</span>
      <h1>Your app idea.<br/><em>A clear way<br/>to build it.</em></h1>
      <p class="app-deck">Mobile app development for businesses in Northern Ireland. Turn an idea or a frustrating process into a useful product for your customers or team.</p>
      <p>Talk directly with Glen Adamson about what you need, who will use it and what a sensible first version could look like. You don’t need a finished specification. Client meetings at CIDO Craigavon are available by appointment.</p>
      <div class="app-capabilities"><span>React Native experience</span><span>Web applications & APIs</span><span>Discovery through delivery</span></div>
      <div class="app-preview" aria-label="Example application workflow, shown for illustration">
        <div class="preview-top"><span>AN IDEA, MADE PRACTICAL</span><span class="pink">ILLUSTRATIVE WORKFLOW</span></div>
        <div class="preview-screen"><div><span class="preview-icon">+</span><strong>A better customer experience</strong><small>Bookings · orders · self-service</small></div><div class="preview-line"></div><div><span class="preview-icon">≡</span><strong>Connected to your business</strong><small>Your team · your systems · your data</small></div></div>
        <p>Plan the whole service behind the screen.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <form class="app-form" id="app-enquiry" action="/api/contact" method="post">
      <span class="eyebrow">LET’S EXPLORE YOUR IDEA</span><h2>What would you<br/>like to build<span class="pink">?</span></h2>
      <p>A few details are enough to start a conversation.</p>
      <input type="hidden" name="service" value="Mobile app development"/><input type="hidden" name="source" value="Website"/><input type="hidden" name="medium" value=""/><input type="hidden" name="campaign" value=""/>
      <label>Your name *<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120"/></label>
      <label>Email address *<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254"/></label>
      <label>Tell me about the app you’d like to build *<textarea name="message" rows="4" required minlength="20" maxlength="6000" placeholder="Who is it for, and what would you like it to do? A couple of sentences is plenty."></textarea></label>
      <label>Phone number <span class="optional">(optional)</span><input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="50"/></label>
      <div class="form-trap" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this field empty<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></label></div>
      <p class="app-privacy">We’ll use your details to reply to this enquiry. You won’t be added to a marketing list. <a href="/privacy">Privacy information</a>.</p>
      <button class="button" type="submit">Discuss my app idea</button>
      <p id="app-form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <p class="app-direct">Prefer email? <a href={'mailto:'+site.email}>{site.email}</a></p>
    </form>
  </section>
  <section class="app-evidence wrap"><span class="eyebrow">EXPERIENCE BEHIND THE CONVERSATION</span><h2>Software for real business workflows.</h2><p>Glen’s consultancy engagements include frontend delivery, connected systems and collaboration with wider product teams. These examples show software engineering experience; they are not standalone mobile apps delivered solely by Modern Software.</p><div class="app-work"><a href="/work/loweconex"><strong>LoweConex</strong><span>React & TypeScript · operational platform</span></a><a href="/work/sensoteq"><strong>Sensoteq</strong><span>Connected industrial systems · React, Node.js & AWS</span></a><a href="/work/terraquest"><strong>TerraQuest</strong><span>Public-service workflows · frontend engineering</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="app-process wrap"><div><span class="eyebrow">A PRACTICAL FIRST STEP</span><h2>Start small.<br/>Build with purpose.</h2><p>We’ll discuss the people using the app, the problem it solves and the systems it needs to connect to. Then we can agree the scope and commercial approach before development begins.</p><a href="https://www.glenadamson.co.uk/about">Meet Glen and explore his background</a></div><div class="app-questions"><details><summary>Do I need an iOS and Android app?</summary><p>It depends on your users and the features they need. We can discuss a React Native mobile app, a responsive web application or a combination before choosing the approach.</p></details><details><summary>What does an app cost?</summary><p>Features, integrations, design, data migration and ongoing support all affect the price. Send a short outline and we can discuss a realistic scope. We won’t promise a price before understanding the work.</p></details><details><summary>Can you help with an existing system?</summary><p>Yes. Consultancy can include frontend development, API integration and working alongside your existing product and engineering team.</p></details></div></section>
  <script>
    const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#app-enquiry');
    if(form){
      const params=new URLSearchParams(location.search);
      for(const [field,param] of [['source','utm_source'],['medium','utm_medium'],['campaign','utm_campaign']]){
        const input=form.elements.namedItem(field) as HTMLInputElement|null;
        const value=params.get(param);if(input&&value)input.value=value.slice(0,180);
      }
      form.addEventListener('submit',async event=>{
        event.preventDefault();const button=form.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('button[type="submit"]')!;const status=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#app-form-status')!;
        if(button.disabled)return;button.disabled=true;button.textContent='Sending…';status.textContent='';
        try{
          const response=await fetch('/api/contact',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form)))});
          const data=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw new Error(data.message||'Unable to send your enquiry. Please try again or email Glen.');
          form.reset();status.textContent='Thank you. Your app enquiry has been sent to Glen. He’ll reply using the details you provided.';
          // Sent only after the server accepts the enquiry; measurement respects cookie preferences.
          window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('modern-software:enquiry-sent',{detail:{service:'mobile-app-development'}}));
        }catch(error){status.textContent=error instanceof Error?error.message:'Unable to send your enquiry. Please email Glen directly.';}
        finally{button.disabled=false;button.textContent='Discuss my app idea';}
      });
    }
  </script>
  <style>
    .app-lead{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;gap:7%;padding-block:70px 80px;align-items:start}.app-intro>.eyebrow,.app-form>.eyebrow,.app-evidence>.eyebrow,.app-process .eyebrow{font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1.3px}.app-intro h1{font-size:clamp(48px,5.4vw,76px);margin:25px 0}.app-intro p,.app-form p,.app-evidence p,.app-process p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.75}.app-intro .app-deck{font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;color:#d1dfd5;margin-bottom:22px}.app-capabilities{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:26px 0}.app-capabilities span{font-size:14px;padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;color:var(--mint)}.app-form{padding:32px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid #657b6b;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 24px 70px #0002}.app-form h2{font-size:38px;margin:15px 0}.app-form>p{margin-bottom:22px}.app-form label{display:block;font-size:16px;margin-top:20px;color:#e1e9e3}.app-form input,.app-form textarea{font-size:16px}.optional{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.app-form .app-privacy{font-size:14px;margin-block:22px;line-height:1.6}.app-form a,.app-process a{color:var(--mint);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.app-form .button{font-size:16px;width:100%;justify-content:center;padding:18px}.app-form .app-direct{font-size:14px;margin:22px 0 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}#app-form-status:empty{display:none}#app-form-status{margin:20px 0 0;color:var(--mint)}.app-preview{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#1e2822;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin-top:32px}.preview-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px}.preview-screen{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;margin:28px 0}.preview-screen>div:not(.preview-line){flex:1}.preview-screen strong,.preview-screen small{display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px}.preview-screen small{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.preview-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:38px;height:38px;border:1px solid #6f9a80;border-radius:9px;color:var(--mint);font-size:24px}.preview-line{width:35px;border-top:1px dashed #71927d}.app-preview p{font-size:14px;color:var(--mint)}.app-evidence{padding-block:55px;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.app-evidence h2{font-size:38px;margin:20px 0}.app-evidence>p{max-width:840px}.app-work{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:30px}.app-work a{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:22px;transition:border-color .2s,background .2s}.app-work a:hover{border-color:var(--mint);background:var(--panel)}.app-work strong,.app-work span{display:block}.app-work strong{font-size:22px;color:var(--mint);margin-bottom:12px}.app-work span{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted)}.app-process{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8%;padding-block:65px 85px}.app-process h2{margin:20px 0}.app-process a{display:inline-block;margin-top:24px;font-size:16px}.app-questions details{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:23px 0}.app-questions summary{font-size:18px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1.5}.app-questions p{margin-top:16px}@media(max-width:850px){.app-lead{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px;padding-block:40px}.app-intro h1{font-size:clamp(48px,10vw,72px)}.app-form{padding:26px 22px}.app-work,.app-process{grid-template-columns:1fr}.app-process{gap:35px;padding-block:45px}.app-evidence h2{font-size:32px}.app-preview{display:none}}
  </style>
</Base>
